        <p>177, Nag's Head-road, Ponders End, London, N., Eng.— First little red pimples used.to come out on my face, particularly around my chin. They were very thick. Then they had little yellow heads, which were very painful when touched. This continued for a long time. "I tried several things, but they never affected them. Then I decided to send for a sample of Cuticura Soap and Ointment. After using the Cuticura Soap and Ointment as directions for pimples I was surprised to see the effect. I got some more, and after three months' treatment my skin is clear and the irritation gone." (Signed) William Upson, Feb. 15, 1913. Cuticnra Soap and Ointment are sold by chemists every- where. A sample of each with 32-p. book post- free from nearest depot Address: Newbery, 27, Charterhouse-square, London; B. Towns &amp; Co., Sydney, N.S.W. ; Lennon, Ltd., Cape Town; Muller, Maclean &amp; Co., Calcutta and Bombay; or "Cuticura," Boston, U.S.A. Men who shave and shampoo with Cuticura Soap will find it best for skin and scalp.</p>
