        <p>Sailing Boat Swamped. high tide yesterday morning in the Mersey i'llsed a small sailing boat moored in the river „,!•ar the Arpley Railway Bridge to be swamped tier. "E her moorings. The boat was raised at low Water also flooded the roadway near the "way Bridge.</p>
