        <p>1:- ~ 1,4,, .3.:1.‘ , 00K-GENERAL, 28 to 40, all duties, family •t :I r: , .i"4 ).' .4, 1 ham. , X 24. Slocock, 40, Coldhurstt ret , Old - ieIOOK-6ENERAL Wanted; PrOtestant; small family; no washing; good references.-11, Langdale-road, New Brighton 4</p>
